{"step_index":983,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T19:06:01Z","thinking":"**Investigating Load Order**\n\nI'm currently focused on the load order within the application, specifically the timing between the `MainWindow`'s loading and the initialization of the web view. My preliminary analysis of the logs shows that the web view initialization, which should occur after the main window is loaded, did not log its initiation. I'm now examining the `MainWindow_Loaded` event to pinpoint potential causes for this discrepancy, expecting to find the issue within the async method call.\n\n\n**Debugging Load Events**\n\nI've added try/catch blocks and logging throughout the `MainWindow_Loaded` event to capture potential exceptions that may interrupt the normal flow, specifically when dealing with the Win32 window initialization and the HwndSource hook. This will help isolate whether issues are caused by null `source` values or exceptions during initialization, improving the error detection process. The logging also indicates the time of each component's initialization.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Wrap MainWindow_Loaded in detailed logging and try/catch in MainWindow.xaml.cs.\"","EndLine":"64","Instruction":"\"Add step-by-step diagnostic logging in MainWindow_Loaded\"","ReplacementContent":"\"        private async void MainWindow_Loaded(object sender, RoutedEventArgs e)\\n        {\\n            try\\n            {\\n                File.AppendAllText(LogPath, $\\\"[START MainWindow_Loaded] at {DateTime.UtcNow}\\\\n\\\");\\n                var helper = new WindowInteropHelper(this);\\n                IntPtr hwnd = helper.Handle;\\n                File.AppendAllText(LogPath, $\\\"[HWND] {hwnd}\\\\n\\\");\\n\\n                _windowManager.Initialize(hwnd);\\n                File.AppendAllText(LogPath, $\\\"[WindowManager] Initialized\\\\n\\\");\\n\\n                _hotkeyManager.Initialize(hwnd);\\n                File.AppendAllText(LogPath, $\\\"[HotkeyManager] Initialized\\\\n\\\");\\n\\n                RegisterGlobalHotkeys();\\n                File.AppendAllText(LogPath, $\\\"[Hotkeys] Registered\\\\n\\\");\\n\\n                var source = HwndSource.FromHwnd(hwnd);\\n                if (source != null)\\n                {\\n                    source.AddHook(WndProc);\\n                    File.AppendAllText(LogPath, $\\\"[HwndSource] Hook added\\\\n\\\");\\n                }\\n\\n                _sessionController.SendToUi += (type, payload) =>\\n                {\\n                    Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\\n                    {\\n                        SendJsonToWeb(type, payload);\\n                    });\\n                };\\n\\n                await InitializeWebViewAsync();\\n                File.AppendAllText(LogPath, $\\\"[MainWindow_Loaded] Complete!\\\\n\\\");\\n            }\\n            catch (Exception ex)\\n            {\\n                File.AppendAllText(LogPath, $\\\"[LOAD ERROR] {ex}\\\\n\\\");\\n            }\\n        }\"","StartLine":"30","TargetContent":"\"        private async void MainWindow_Loaded(object sender, RoutedEventArgs e)\\n        {\\n            var helper = new WindowInteropHelper(this);\\n            IntPtr hwnd = helper.Handle;\\n\\n            // Initialize Win32 window management (Capture protection, click-through, transparency)\\n            _windowManager.Initialize(hwnd);\\n            _hotkeyManager.Initialize(hwnd);\\n            RegisterGlobalHotkeys();\\n\\n            // Hook HwndSource to receive WM_HOTKEY messages\\n            var source = HwndSource.FromHwnd(hwnd);\\n            source.AddHook(WndProc);\\n\\n            // Connect SessionController events to UI\\n            _sessionController.SendToUi += (type, payload) =>\\n            {\\n                Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\\n                {\\n                    SendJsonToWeb(type, payload);\\n                });\\n            };\\n\\n            File.AppendAllText(LogPath, $\\\"MainWindow Loaded at {DateTime.UtcNow}\\\\n\\\");\\n\\n            // Initialize WebView2\\n            await InitializeWebViewAsync();\\n        }\"","TargetFile":"\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Arthur Henrique\\\\Documents\\\\GitHub\\\\Spectra\\\\src-csharp\\\\UI\\\\MainWindow.xaml.cs\"","toolAction":"\"Adding step logging to MainWindow_Loaded\"","toolSummary":"\"Update MainWindow_Loaded logging\""}}]}
